# Package categories for the Alike dependency rules.
#
# Decision record: Docs/adr/0004-package-dependencies.md
# Stage 5 of the clean-code epic adds tools/check-package-graph. It reads this
# file and checks each edge against the matrix in ADR-0004.
#
# Format: one line `<Package> <Category>`. Lines that start with `#` are comments.
# Categories: App, Feature, Foundation, Utility, Tool.
# "Foundation with UI" (UserGuide, Diagnostics, and the
# PurchasesUI product of Purchases) uses the Foundation rules, so it is
# written as Foundation here.
# A change to this file needs a new ADR (see ADR-0004).

# App: the Xcode targets. AlikeTests belongs to Alike (ADR-0004), so it is App too.
# Each Xcode target that links a package product needs a line.
